!results/README.md

# Scientific binary artifacts that should not enter normal Git history
*.ome.tif
*.ome.tiff
*.tif
*.tiff
*.qptiff
*.rds
*.RData
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.h5ad
*.zarr
*.zarr.zip
*.parquet
*.mtx
*.mtx.gz
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Logs and OS/editor noise
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
